      "title": "support_security.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #1E293B; background: #FFFFFF; }\n    .slide-container { width: 1280px; min-height: 720px; background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 60px; position: relative; }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 40px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A192F; border-left: 4px solid #1D4ED8; padding-left: 16px; }\n    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; flex: 1; }\n    .card { background: #E0E7FF; border-top: 4px solid #0A192F; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; }\n    .card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A192F; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; }\n    .card h3 i { margin-right: 12px; color: #1D4ED8; }\n    .contact-item { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n    .contact-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #1D4ED8; margin-right: 16px; font-size: 20px; }\n    .contact-text { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A192F; }\n    .warning-text { font-size: 16px; color: #1E293B; line-height: 1.6; }\n    .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 60px; right: 60px; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h2>Security and support</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3><i class=\"fas fa-headset\"></i> Official Support</h3>\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"contact-text\">btech.smm1@gmail.com</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"contact-text\">+254 112 887 428</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-globe\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"contact-text\">btechsmm.store</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3><i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt\"></i> Account Protection</h3>\n        <p class=\"warning-text\">Never disclose your password, one-time authentication codes, or your M-Pesa PIN to anyone—even if they claim to be from BTECH SMM support.</p>\n        <br>\n        <p class=\"warning-text\">Ensure you are visiting the official website at **btechsmm.store** before entering any account information.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">Page 8</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
