      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF; background: #0A192F; }\n    .slide-container { width: 1280px; min-height: 720px; background: #0A192F; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 60px; text-align: center; }\n    h1 { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.2; }\n    .subtitle { font-size: 24px; color: #E0E7FF; max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; }\n    .brand-logo img { max-width: 300px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; }\n    .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 60px; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <h1>Share with clarity.<br>Grow with trust.</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Take your time, make informed decisions, and explore the ambassador features that work for you.</p>\n    <div class=\"brand-logo\">\n      <img src=\"C:\\Users\\Becam Aziz\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\BTECH-SMM\\BTECH-SMM\\assets\\brand\\btech-smm-logo.png\" alt=\"BTECH SMM Logo\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      Visit btechsmm.store to get started\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
